<<<
See A)wWAKE(N. Walach, Walachian, not Wall-, is the OED preferred spelling. wale, weal, wheal.
===
See ^^A)WAKE(N^^.

**Walach, Walachian,** not *Wall-*, is the OED preferred spelling.

**wale, weal, wheal.**
