<<<
For the mark left on flesh by a cane &c., the right word appears to be wale; this was confused with wheal, properly a pimple or pustule, & weal was a wrong correction of the mistake.
===
For the mark left on flesh by a cane &c., the right word appears to be *wale*; this was confused with *wheal*, properly a pimple or pustule, & *weal* was a wrong correction of the mistake.
>>>

